ambda }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)+5B\\sqrt{\\lambda }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)=0\n$$\n\nwhich gives $B=0.$ So, we have\n\n$$\ny=A\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x\\sqrt{\\lambda }).\n$$\n\nApplying the boundary condition ${y}^{′}(\\pi )=0$ yields\n\n$$\n-5A\\sqrt{\\lambda }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5\\pi \\sqrt{\\lambda })=0.\n$$\n\nFor nontrivial solutions, we require \n\n$$\n5\\pi \\sqrt{\\lambda }=n\\pi \n$$\n\nfor $n\\in N.$ This gives the parameter values corresponding to the eigenvalues:\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }_{n}=\\frac{{n}^{2}}{25}.\n$$\n\nThe corresponding eigenfunctions are \n\n$$\n{y}_{n}(x)={B}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x\\sqrt{{\\lambda }_{n}}),\\,{B}_{n}\\in R.\n$$" 13194139535924 true] [17592186374678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374679 13194139535924 true] [17592186374678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374680 13194139535924 true] [17592186374678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374681 13194139535924 true] [17592186374678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374682 13194139535924 true] [17592186374678 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139535924 true] [17592186374678 1041 "field-1" 13194139535924 true] [17592186374678 1104 #edb/ref 17592186374680 13194139535924 true] [17592186374678 1110 #uuid "169b79ce-78f5-5ef8-9444-bf12ad43c40b" 13194139535924 true] [17592186374679 1034 "\\frac{{n}^{2}}{10}" 13194139535924 true] [17592186374679 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535924 true] [17592186374679 1111 #uuid "8bedc359-7d2a-5f82-9f14-82db352d3d0b" 13194139535924 true] [17592186374680 1034 "\\frac{{n}^{2}}{25}" 13194139535924 true] [17592186374680 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535924 true] [17592186374680 1111 #uuid "4ed42872-9fbb-5c01-8ee4-255df2140180" 13194139535924 true] [17592186374681 1034 "\\frac{{n}^{2}}{5}" 13194139535924 true] [17592186374681 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535924 true] [17592186374681 1111 #uuid "1c14b9ee-e58f-516c-a1a3-195c750de2e0" 13194139535924 true] [17592186374682 1034 "\\frac{{n}^{2}}{50}" 13194139535924 true] [17592186374682 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535924 true] 